nksva","html_url":"https://github.com/mlinksva","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2021-07-22T17:02:23Z","updated_at":"2021-07-22T17:02:23Z","body":"I'm pretty sure @apotheon is the steward/author.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/885069505/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/887773457","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-887773457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":887773457,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8406lkR","user":{"login":"apotheon","id":467053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzA1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/467053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon","html_url":"https://github.com/apotheon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-07-27T19:24:35Z","updated_at":"2021-07-27T19:36:05Z","body":"Yes, that's me.\r\n\r\nI don't know an email address for the submitter.  Do you need mine?  The form is not specific on that point, where the author/steward and submitter are different people.  I'm also not sure whether contact via GitHub is sufficient, or if you need an email address per se.\r\n\r\nI don't object to the submission, for what that's worth.  If you want to ask me any questions about it, feel free, and I'll try to answer as I find the time.\r\n\r\nThe comments section, I see, indicates a request for information about a need for the submitted license.   I'll try to offer some information about that here:\r\n\r\nThe COIL was created for the purpose of filling the niche of a copyfree license with patent license for recipients.  The Apache License 2 is often treated as the closest approximation of this available, but it is hindered by project organization and bookkeeping clauses that impose restrictions on the work outside of the license itself, and by license incompatibilities that should not affect the COIL.  It is further differentiated from other licenses in that it is designed to be suitable for use with software projects and equally suitable for many non-software copyrightable works (e.g. works of natural language text).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/887773457/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/893576181","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-893576181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":893576181,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841QuP1","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-05T16:02:15Z","updated_at":"2021-08-05T16:02:15Z","body":"Thanks @apotheon - mostly we just want to make sure the license steward is aware of the submission and doesn't have any objections, etc. \r\n\r\na quick search on Github - https://github.com/search?q=%22Copyfree+Open+Innovation+License%22&type=code - shows some use by a variety of repos, so I'm generally in favor of adding it.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/893576181/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/893612331","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-893612331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":893612331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841Q3Er","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-05T16:54:26Z","updated_at":"2021-08-05T16:54:26Z","body":"Discussed on 2021-08-05 legal team call. Noting that this request is for version 0.6 of the license, and the versions at the link from @jlovejoy above appear to be for prior versions (0.3, 0.4, 0.5).\r\n\r\n@apotheon the following might be questions that you can weigh in on:\r\n* Are there other projects using v0.6?\r\n* And/or, is there a request to add prior versions 0.3-0.5 as separate entries?\r\n\r\nFor SPDX, we aim to be as specific as possible about versioning licenses so that they can be identified accurately. Grateful for your thoughts here.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/893612331/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/893630011","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-893630011","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":893630011,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841Q7Y7","user":{"login":"apotheon","id":467053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzA1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/467053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon","html_url":"https://github.com/apotheon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-05T17:14:55Z","updated_at":"2021-08-05T17:14:55Z","body":"I wouldn't necessarily recommend adding versions prior to 0.6 at this time, unless maintaining historical record of prior versions in SPDX is somehow desirable for the SPDX core goals.  There are other projects using 0.6, but I don't have a catalog of them other than some of my own projects.  I'll get back to you on that, at least with links to a couple of mine.  I'll check with others who might have some projects to suggest as well.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/893630011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/893945676","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-893945676","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":893945676,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841SIdM","user":{"login":"mlinksva","id":40415,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40415?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva","html_url":"https://github.com/mlinksva","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2021-08-06T01:58:07Z","updated_at":"2021-08-06T01:58:07Z","body":"Should the short identifier be `COIL-0.6`?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/893945676/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/893955915","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-893955915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":893955915,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841SK9L","user":{"login":"apotheon","id":467053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzA1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/467053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon","html_url":"https://github.com/apotheon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-06T02:27:09Z","updated_at":"2021-08-06T02:27:09Z","body":"That works for me, and fits the pattern I recall from other licenses on the SPDX list.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/893955915/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/894493206","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-894493206","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":894493206,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841UOIW","user":{"login":"apotheon","id":467053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzA1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/467053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon","html_url":"https://github.com/apotheon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-06T20:09:24Z","updated_at":"2021-08-06T20:12:20Z","body":"I should probably just list some projects of mine now rather than wait for others to report back on whether they have some worth sharing:\r\n\r\n* [Droll](https://rubygems.org/gems/droll)\r\n* [FossGit](https://fossrec.com/u/apotheon/fossgit/index.cgi/file?name=LICENSE&ci=tip)\r\n* [q](https://fossrec.com/u/apotheon/q/index.cgi/file?name=LICENSE&ci=tip)\r\n* [RedRug](https://rubygems.org/gems/redrug)\r\n* [Versionize](https://rubygems.org/gems/versionize)\r\n\r\nAll links lead to either a RubyGems page indicating COIL usage (with \"Source Code\" link to the relevant version control repository, where version 0.6 can verified) or directly to a file in the project's version control repository that indicates use of COIL-0.6.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/894493206/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/894870966","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-894870966","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":894870966,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841VqW2","user":{"login":"apotheon","id":467053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzA1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/467053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon","html_url":"https://github.com/apotheon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-08T23:15:33Z","updated_at":"2021-08-13T18:05:41Z","body":"info about the legal form of the COIL-0.6 license:\r\n\r\nThe current patent clause reflects changes suggested to me on an occasion a few years ago when a patent lawyer I know (a former engineer who specializes in tech/engineering patent law) looked over the license.  Apart from the comment that prompted the changes (a matter of making potential users' lawyers less nervous more than a matter of substantive legal consequences per se), and he gave it his (unofficial) seal of approval as a patent clause for a software license.\r\n\r\nI recently asked a lawyer who deals with copyright, patent, contract, and licensing law to review the license.  The results were promising.  In her analysis, she explained it in terms that matched the intentions in drafting it (without having been told those intentions in advance)  She also described it as being fairly standard/straightforward in the context of legal interpretation and term usage, generally appearing to conform to the requirements of the Copyfree Standard Definition and Open Source Definition, presenting no obvious difficulties for license compatibility purposes, and being very safe for recipients as far as copyright law is concerned (though of course the disclaimer language comes with the standard lawyer caveat about how if something bad happens because of your use of the covered work you're legally on your own).\r\n\r\nI did not establish a lawyer-client relationship with either of them, though they gave me best-effort analyses, and the second of them was a paid consultation.  As a result, I'm not prepared to refer to them by name (given legal issues involved and the fact I don't want to get sued by a lawyer for inadvertently implying a lawyer-client relationship) at this time, though I'm considering establishing such a relationship with the second of the two for purposes of further license related work.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/894870966/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/894871080","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-894871080","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":894871080,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841VqYo","user":{"login":"apotheon","id":467053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzA1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/467053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon","html_url":"https://github.com/apotheon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-08T23:16:09Z","updated_at":"2021-08-12T23:31:25Z","body":"info about other projects using the COIL-0.6 license:\r\n\r\nI asked around among people I know, and came up with a few projects using this\r\nlicense.  Each comes with links to project and license information.\r\n\r\n* dupliqr.github.io: light web application to decode, repair, and copy QR codes\r\n\r\n    * [GitHub](https://github.com/dupliqr/dupliqr.github.io)\r\n\r\n* finance-visualizer: HTML visualization tools for CSV financial data\r\n\r\n    * [GitHub](https://github.com/pbrunner/finance-visualizer)\r\n\r\n* jetty-http-server-wrapper: easy deployment tool for Jetty servers\r\n\r\n    * [GitHub](https://github.com/palominolabs/jetty-http-server-wrapper)\r\n\r\n* libstdgb: C library for Game Boy development\r\n\r\n    * [GitHub](https://github.com/delwink/libstdgb)\r\n\r\n* serverless-cf-vars: JavaScript library\r\n\r\n    * [GitLab](https://gitlab.com/kabo/serverless-cf-vars)\r\n    * [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/serverless-cf-vars)\r\n    * [Yarn](https://yarnpkg.com/package/serverless-cf-vars)\r\n\r\n* ttt: arbitrary size Tic Tac Toe implementation\r\n\r\n    * [GitHub](https://github.com/2mac/ttt)\r\n    \r\nI know of some other projects using older COIL versions where I'm informing the \r\nmaintainers of the legal analysis of the 0.6 version and suggesting they update \r\nthe license to that version.  That may result in the number of users of\r\nCOIL-0.6 increasing in the near future as well.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNOTE: The metrics-guice project, originally submitted as an example of a \r\nproject using the COIL, has been updated to COIL-0.6, so the rest of these\r\nprojects I list may not be particularly relevant now.  I'm not sure if more is\r\nbetter in this case.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/894871080/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/894871640","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-894871640","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":894871640,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841VqhY","user":{"login":"apotheon","id":467053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzA1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/467053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon","html_url":"https://github.com/apotheon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-08T23:19:38Z","updated_at":"2021-08-08T23:19:38Z","body":"(Someone let me know if I shouldn't dump so much text here.)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/894871640/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/902002766","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-902002766","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":902002766,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841w3hO","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-19T15:17:41Z","updated_at":"2021-08-19T15:17:41Z","body":"Thanks @apotheon for adding the details here! Greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nI'm not doing a full write-up of this license under the [SPDX license inclusion principles](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/master/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md) at the moment, but from a quick look my view is that this license likely complies with the OSD. Given that, the license being structured to be generally usable by anyone, and the demonstrated use by various third parties, I'm a +1 to add COIL-0.6 to the license list. I'll plan to bring this up during the SPDX legal team call today.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/902002766/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/902085348","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-902085348","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":902085348,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841xLrk","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-19T17:02:41Z","updated_at":"2021-08-19T17:02:41Z","body":"Discussed on 2021-08-19 legal team call. \r\n\r\nSome comments about curiosity on why the license has a 0.6 version number (which could be interpreted as being pre-release), but SPDX generally defers to license stewards on the versioning they choose to use. @apotheon Does the version 0.6 numbering signal that the license is still in the midst of drafting, or is the text finalized for use with this version number? And/or, if this is planned to be the final stable version, is there a plan to bump it to 1.0?\r\n\r\nIf text is final, then good to add; but future versions (such as a 0.7 or 1.0) would need to be evaluated on their own for whether they meet the inclusion principles.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/902085348/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/902121805","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-902121805","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":902121805,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE841xUlN","user":{"login":"apotheon","id":467053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzA1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/467053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon","html_url":"https://github.com/apotheon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-19T17:55:15Z","updated_at":"2021-08-19T17:55:15Z","body":"I'm inclined to actually bump it to 1.0 at this point, thanks to (very recent) review by a lawyer and SPDX consideration.  Is there any reason this would cause any concern or difficulty with relation to the SPDX process, or should I just declare this 1.0 to settle formal concerns over version numbering?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/902121805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/904608861","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-904608861","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":904608861,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8416zxd","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-24T12:46:31Z","updated_at":"2021-08-24T12:46:31Z","body":"@apotheon I'd say, once you publish it as 1.0 and confirm that the text is fixed and won't change for that version number, let's go with that on the license list and add it to the list as `COIL-1.0`. Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/904608861/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/904899675","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-904899675","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":904899675,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE84176xb","user":{"login":"apotheon","id":467053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzA1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/467053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon","html_url":"https://github.com/apotheon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apotheon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-24T19:04:36Z","updated_at":"2021-08-25T21:18:37Z","body":"The license version number has been updated to 1.0 with no changes to license terms from the 0.6 version as shared here, and as legally reviewed.  No changes to the license are planned, expected, or considered at this time, and if at some point a modified version becomes desirable I do not see any reason for it to be applied without a version number change.  I believe its current form is about as good as it can get, given current legal climate and other information available to me at this time.\r\n\r\nThank you for your feedback and patience.\r\n\r\n(I'll update the license version mentions on my own projects to 1.0 now.)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/904899675/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/906547881","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273#issuecomment-906547881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1273","id":906547881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE842CNKp","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/r